# Excluded from uploads by `vercel deploy`, which does not read .gitignore.
#
# `.env` matters most: it is a secret, and production configuration lives in the Vercel
# projects' environment variables instead. Build output and dependencies are rebuilt
# remotely, and neither project builds the mobile app.

